# Curated layer of G_P: facts missing from Wikidata, each annotated in
# RDF-star with its source and our confidence in it (paper, Sec. 4.1.1).
# Relations reuse Wikidata property IRIs, so type-level weights apply.
@prefix nami: <https://example.org/nami/ontology#> .
@prefix wd:  <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/> .
@prefix wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Oppenheimer (2023) shot exteriors at the University of Zurich and the Grossmuenster.
